---
// /terms — regulamin świadczenia usług drogą elektroniczną (Art. 8 ustawy z 18.07.2002
// o świadczeniu usług drogą elektroniczną). Zakres celowo ograniczony do usług REALNIE
// działających dziś na stronie (formularz kontaktowy + booking rozmowy) — żadna płatna
// umowa nie jest jeszcze zawierana przez stronę, więc nie ma tu klauzul sprzedażowych ani
// prawa odstąpienia. Rozszerzyć o warunki sprzedaży dopiero gdy powstanie płatny checkout
// na stronie. Usługodawca = Kacper Mioduszewski jako osoba fizyczna (JDG zawieszona,
// patrz mioduszewsky-com/STATUS.md — gate prawny 27.07.2026). Aktualizować przy każdej
// zmianie zakresu usług elektronicznych na stronie lub przy reaktywacji działalności.
import VariantLayout from '../layouts/VariantLayout.astro';
const updated = '27 July 2026';
---

<VariantLayout
  title="Terms of service · mioduszewsky"
  bg="#f8f9f2"
  fg="#000000"
  switcher={false}
  robots="index, follow"
  description="Terms for using the contact form and call booking on mioduszewsky.com."
>
  <main class="doc">
    <header class="doc-nav">
      <a class="mark" href="/" aria-label="mioduszewsky — back home">
        <video autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="auto" aria-hidden="true" poster="/logo3d/logo-nav-poster.webp">
          <source src="/logo3d/logo-nav.mp4" type="video/mp4;codecs=hvc1" />
          <source src="/logo3d/logo-nav.webm" type="video/webm" />
        </video>
      </a>
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back</a>
    </header>

    <article class="doc-body">
      <p class="label">( Legal )</p>
      <h1>Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="upd">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        These terms cover the electronic services currently provided on
        <strong>mioduszewsky.com</strong>: the contact form and call-booking tool. They
        follow the Polish Act on Providing Services by Electronic Means (18 July 2002).
        They do not cover paid project work — any paid engagement is agreed separately,
        in writing, before it begins.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Who provides this service</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Kacper Mioduszewski</strong>, a private individual, ul. Fromborska 66,
        54-111 Wrocław, Poland. Contact:
        <a href="mailto:kacper@mioduszewsky.com">kacper@mioduszewsky.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What these terms cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact form</strong> — sending a message through the form on <a href="/contact/">/contact</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Call booking</strong> — scheduling a call through the embedded Google Calendar booking tool.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Both are free, informational services meant to start a conversation. Neither
        creates a paid contract by itself. If we agree to work together, that is a
        separate agreement with its own scope, price and schedule.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Technical requirements</h2>
      <p>
        To use these services you need a modern web browser with JavaScript enabled, an
        internet connection, and a valid email address you can access.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Rules of use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to submit unlawful, abusive or fraudulent content through the
        contact form, and not to use it to send unsolicited advertising (spam).
        Messages that look automated or abusive may be ignored or blocked.
      </p>

      <h2>5. How the service starts and ends</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting the contact form, or booking a call, is a request to use the
        service — it is accepted the moment you send it, and it ends once I have
        replied to your message or the booked call has taken place. You can stop using
        either service at any time simply by not using it again; there is nothing to
        cancel.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Complaints</h2>
      <p>
        If something about the form or booking tool does not work as expected (for
        example, you get an error, or never receive a reply), email
        <a href="mailto:kacper@mioduszewsky.com">kacper@mioduszewsky.com</a> describing
        what happened. I aim to respond within 5 business days.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Data and privacy</h2>
      <p>
        What data is collected through these services and how it is used is explained
        in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by Polish law.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If the scope of these services changes (for example, if a paid checkout is
        added to the site), these terms will be updated first and the “last updated”
        date above will change.
      </p>
    </article>

    <footer class="doc-foot">
      <span>© 2026 mioduszewsky</span>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <style>
    @font-face { font-family: 'NohemiV'; src: url('/fonts/Nohemi-Variable.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 100 900; font-display: swap; }
    @font-face { font-family: 'GeneralSansV'; src: url('/fonts/GeneralSans-Variable.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight: 200 700; font-display: swap; }

    .doc {
      --ink:#000; --ivory:#f8f9f2; --dim:#8b8677; --blue:#0522ff;
      font-family:'GeneralSansV',sans-serif; background:var(--ivory); color:var(--ink);
      min-height:100svh; padding:0 6vw 6vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    }
    .doc-nav { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:20px 0; }
    .doc-nav .mark { display:inline-block; width:54px; height:54px; }
    .doc-nav .mark video { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; }
    .back { text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink); font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .back:hover { color:var(--blue); }
    .label { font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.26em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--dim); }
    .doc-body { max-width:66ch; margin:5vh 0; }
    .doc-body h1 { font-family:'NohemiV',sans-serif; font-weight:520; letter-spacing:-0.025em; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.6rem); margin:1rem 0 0.4rem; }
    .upd { color:var(--dim); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:2.5rem; }
    .doc-body h2 { font-family:'NohemiV',sans-serif; font-weight:540; letter-spacing:-0.015em; font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.5rem); margin:2.4rem 0 0.8rem; }
    .doc-body p, .doc-body li { font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a382f; }
    .doc-body ul { margin:0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.2rem; }
    .doc-body li { margin-bottom:0.5rem; }
    .doc-body a { color:var(--blue); }
    .doc-foot { display:flex; gap:1.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:auto; padding-top:6vh; font-size:12px; color:var(--dim); letter-spacing:0.04em; }
    .doc-foot a { color:var(--dim); text-decoration:none; }
    .doc-foot a:hover { color:var(--ink); }
  </style>
</VariantLayout>
